{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:75c35831147e4f9a","name":"Technometry","source":{"id":"source:reference-75c35831147e4f9a","title":"Technometry","revision":20066,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:08:25Z","sha256":"634db081c48de096c1d3e9872f48fd675119171687a065ef70c66e4c12a1e2f8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20066","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Technometry&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-75c35831147e4f9a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can tap into and read technological devices and, in some cases, control them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," or electronic device touched.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," Compare the result to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},". If the check equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", you discover one piece of information contained within the target's memory as determined by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Access Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Access_Information"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," skill. For every 5 points by which you exceed the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", you can learn one additional piece of information.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Alternatively, if you target a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," and succeed at your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, you may choose one of the following effects and apply it to the targeted ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},":\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["The Droid's senses are jammed, allowing you to make ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," until the end of your next turn, even though it is aware of you."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," is denied its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against your next attack made before the end of your next turn."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["On its next two turns, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," does nothing except flee from you at top speed."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to learn two more pieces of information or extend one of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},"-specific effects of this Force Power by one additional round.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
